	document the military-grade code quality and resilience principles,
	licensing implications of the AGPL for network use, and the
	contribution workflow.  Keep the existing License notice.
	Add a link to the Turkish translation.

	* README.tr.md: New file.  Turkish (Türkiye Türkçesi) translation
	of README.md with a link back to the English version.  The License
	notice is kept in English, identical to README.md.

	* ChangeLog: New file.  Record all changes in US English.

